  "content": "<p>本模組為Macaw的橋樑/柵欄/屋頂/傢俱/階梯/小徑/活板門/門/窗戶系列模組，以及TerraformersMC所創建模組提供多重兼容性。</p><p>無論是Traverse、Cinderscapes還是Terrestria皆可支援。</p><p>本模組會自動使用其他模組的材料來生成橋樑/屋頂或柵欄。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此為Macaw模組的非官方擴充套件，若發生崩潰或錯誤請至<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報區</a></strong>回報。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>支援模組：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Traverse</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1109/231/2025-02-25_19.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Cinderscapes</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1109/233/2025-02-25_21.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Terrestria</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1109/232/2025-02-25_21.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>選用依賴：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw系列模組</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Traverse (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE版</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC版</a>)</p><p>Cinderscapes (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE版</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC版</a>)</p><p>Terrestria (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrestria-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE版</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrestria\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC版</a>)</p>",
